title Vinyl 0.8.0: Music folders with network shares (Folders boards): home-share (the server glyph, "192.168.68.142 / home-share", its tracks, a chevron), office-nas not answering (amber, slashed, "Not answering: N tracks kept"), the Add row; a share selected: its panel at the right (800x480) or its bar (Rescan, Remove)
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY full
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE library
env VINYL_DEMO_SHARES 1
keyboards 1
wait 1200
key m
wait 500
tap "Library"
wait 700
tap "Music folders"
wait 900
shot 01-music-folders-shares
expect text "home-share"
expect text "192.168.68.142 / home-share"
expect text "office-nas"
expect text "Not answering: 2 tracks kept"
expect text "Add a network folder"
expect text "Add a folder"
tap "home-share"
wait 500
shot 02-share-selected
expect text "Rescan"
expect text "Remove"
expect notext "Add a folder"
@800x480 expect text "Network folder (SMB)"
@800x480 expect text "Share: home-share"
tap "Rescan"
wait 300
shot 03-rescan
expect text "Scanning home-share."
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
expect noquit
